name: ['Browbeat', 'Kitchen Finks', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Magma Jet', 'Merrow Reejerey', 'Mulldrifter', 'Murderous Redcap', 'Myr Enforcer', 'Oblivion Ring', 'Sakura-Tribe Elder', 'Watchwolf', "Wren's Run Vanquisher"]
